OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'overwhelmed' by community
OL,4,Ahelp after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose aunt and uncle's home was
OL,7,Fdestroyed in a fire said the family
OL,8,Fhave been "overwhelmed" by the
OL,9,Foutpouring of support from the
OL,10,Fcommunity.
OL,12,FThe blaze broke out in the three-storey
OL,13,Fhome of Andrew and Corrina Clarke on
OL,14,FHorse Fair Lane, Rothwell,
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire, on 30 July.
OL,17,FTheir nephew, Jake Clarke, said the
OL,18,Ffamily lost most of their belongings
OL,19,Fafter a "faulty extension" lead caught
OL,20,Ffire on the second floor and then
OL,21,Fspread to the top floors and loft.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
